# Shell-created untracked state. The repository-root `.gitjig/` holds this
# clone's own binding state and the operational evidence root `.gitjig/state/`
# the runtime writes; neither is ever committed (§5.5). The pattern is anchored
# because the runtime computes that path at the repository root and nowhere
# else, so the exclusion covers exactly what the shell creates.
/.gitjig/

# Dev-and-CI dependency tree. Never committed, never part of the substrate an
# adopting repository receives.
/node_modules/
